OL,3,AOpenAI says it cracked 90-year-old
OL,4,Amaths problem in 88 hours
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpenAI says it has found a solution to
OL,7,Fa decades-old advanced maths problem in
OL,8,Fa matter of hours using a new
OL,9,Fartificial intelligence (AI) model and
OL,10,Fthousands of AI bots.
OL,12,FThe ChatGPT-maker said on Tuesday that
OL,13,Fby focusing a group of roughly 10,000
OL,14,FAI agents, or AI bots that undertake
OL,15,Ftasks somewhat autonomously, it solved
OL,16,Fa notoriously difficult maths problem
OL,17,Fin just 88 hours.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
PN,11904
SC,0004
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1788907691
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AOpenAI says it cracked 90-year-old
OL,4,Amaths problem in 88 hours
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe problem was part of the
OL,7,FNavier-Stokes equations, which concern
OL,8,Fhow fluids move. For 90 years important
OL,9,Faspects of the problems have lacked a
OL,10,Fproof, the argument underlying a
OL,11,Fcorrect math equation.
OL,13,FOpenAI called the solution which it
OL,14,Ffound a "milestone" and evidence that
OL,15,FAI tools are improving quickly.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
