OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1788907691
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,ANew law to force tech firms to stop
OL,4,Achildren taking or sharing nude images
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has said it will
OL,7,Fintroduce a new law to force tech firms
OL,8,Fto prevent children from taking or
OL,9,Fsharing nude images on mobile devices.
OL,11,FApple and Google, which develop the
OL,12,Foperating systems of most smartphones
OL,13,Fused in the UK, were given three months
OL,14,Fin June to block access to nude images
OL,15,Fon smartphones and other devices used
OL,16,Fby under-18s.
OL,18,FBut culture secretary Lisa Nandy MP
OL,19,Ftold MPs on Tuesday that despite
OL,20,F"significant commitments" from both
OL,21,Fcompanies, current proposals "do not
OL,22,Fmeet the scale of this crisis".
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,108,105,200,160,0,100
PN,11906
