CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1788907691
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,ANew law to force tech firms to stop
OL,4,Achildren taking or sharing nude images
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said ministers would look to
OL,7,Flegislate "as soon as they can" - with
OL,8,Fthe caveat it may reassess these if
OL,9,Ffirms develop and implement solutions
OL,10,Fsooner.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
