OL,3,ANigella praised as new Bake Off judge
OL,4,Aas latest contestants announced
OL,5,
OL,6,FTV chef Nigella Lawson has been praised
OL,7,Fby critics for her new role as a judge
OL,8,Fon The Great British Bake Off, which
OL,9,Freturns to Channel 4 later this month.
OL,11,FLawson is taking over from Dame Prue
OL,12,FLeith, who said she was leaving the
OL,13,Fseries in order to "work less and play
OL,14,Fmore." The new series kicks off on 22
OL,15,FSeptember but the opening episode was
OL,16,Fshown to critics earlier this week.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
